# Update

Update content when the device, the integration or the household changes. Write a [change note](../writing-guidelines/change-notes.html) when the meaning changes.

<h2 id="wg-092">Keep editing dates apart from device dates</h2>

“Updated” means the writing changed. A device reading has its own time. Never show one as the other.

| Before | After |
| --- | --- |
| Updated 11 November 2026 (on a temperature card) | Last reported 09:15 today. |
| Last updated: 9 November (on the help page) | Page last changed 9 November 2026. |

<h2 id="wg-093">Record exceptions and confirmed problems</h2>

If you break a rule on purpose, write down why. If a review finds a problem, record it with where it is and who will fix it.

| Before | After |
| --- | --- |
| (Rule ignored. No note.) | Exception: the Welsh label “Golau” stays at 4 characters because the card has room for 6. Agreed by the Civica maintainers, 15 November 2026. |
| Some issues found. | Finding: “Turn on” on the hall card has no room name. Owner: the Civica maintainers. Fix by 30 November 2026. |
